  "phoneSelfCheckReason": "{reason, select, busy{The phone or channel is busy.} unsupported{This device or peer does not support this check.} cancelled{This request was cancelled or retired.} disabled{Phone control is turned off.} locked{The device is locked.} identity{The original run or channel no longer matches.} invalid{The request or result could not be verified.} display{The temporary display could not be verified.} input{Input acceptance or delivery was not confirmed. Sent input is not retried.} cleanup{Resource cleanup is unconfirmed. Retry only cleanup.} denied{The system denied the operation.} timeout{The operation timed out; sent work may still complete.} unavailable{The local status or selected channel is unavailable.} target_unavailable{The fixed target could not be verified. Finish cleanup before starting again.} target_changed{The original target changed. Continue only with cleanup.} target_cleanup{Target cleanup is unconfirmed. Retry only cleanup.} target_main{The target was observed on MAIN. Further steps stopped; complete cleanup.} target_readback{The fixed target count or text did not match. Do not repeat the action; complete cleanup.} tree_cleanup{Tree connection cleanup is unconfirmed. Retry only cleanup.} target_launch{Target launch was denied or unconfirmed. Check the device and complete cleanup.} frame_unavailable{No usable local pattern frame was observed. Complete cleanup before a new check.} frame_mismatch{The actual frame did not match this target and phase. Complete cleanup.} continuity{The limited controlled refresh sequence was not confirmed. This is not a frame-rate result.} main_changed{MAIN samples changed; this may include user actions. Complete cleanup. This does not establish the cause.} main_unchanged{No change was seen at these finite sampling points. Disturbance between them remains unknown.} main_incomplete{MAIN samples are incomplete. They cannot establish absence of disturbance.} not_installed{This self-check does not include OCR. OCR was not tested.} other{An unrecognized result was received.}}",
